Workspace for Displaying and Editing Pictures

"Do the following once (i.e. the first time you want to display pictures):"
	Snapshot, quit Smalltalk, then in the Alto Executive, type the following:
		@Load Pictures.dm<cr>
	This will unpack the six pictures files from the file called Pictures.dm.
	Then startup Smalltalk as follows:
		@Snap<cr>
	You may now display and edit pictures"

"Displaying"
